      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The analysis of 78 questionnaires of patients with recurrence of rectal cancer was performed which revealed this complication of surgery to occur in 60% of cases within a year after operation. Recurrences of the rectum cancer show a characteristic complex of symptoms with a certain structure of painful sensations as a central criterion."},
